{
  "id": 8867179495623,
  "title": "Personalized Baseball Bedding Full Size Flag Custom Name D - Design 07",
  "handle": "personalized-baseball-bedding-full-size-flag-custom-name-d-design-07",
  "body_html": "<p>Elevate your bedroom with this personalized Baseball Comforter Set, designed for ultimate comfort and style. Featuring a dynamic baseball theme, this bedding set is a thoughtful gift for any baseball player, fan, or lover, bringing a touch of personalized flair to their space.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> Perfect for baseball players, fans, and lovers, celebrating their passion for the sport.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), and US King (104\" x 88\").</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Manufacturing:</strong> Features environmental protection techniques for dye retention and fade prevention, with smooth, fine, and compact stitching for lasting durability.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Comfy Material:</strong> Made from 100% Brushed Polyester Fabric with whole-piece Microfiber Filling, ensuring a soft, comfy, durable, and lightweight feel.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; air dry without heat. Microfiber dries quickly and becomes fluffier after washing.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize with 2 text inputs for a unique touch.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> This set includes a duvet cover.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester, Cotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Microfiber Filling</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Baseball Thunder</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Baseball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), US King (104\" x 88\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Breathable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>400</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Duvet Cover</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
